  "routeAdjustment": "Reuse the existing actual residue homomorphism, universal inverse evaluation and all-points finite-place order theorem. Adapt only the needed uniformizer-division and branch-uniqueness argument from the archived external proof, replacing its preliminary place/residue facts by existing local results. Universal inverse evaluation removes auxiliary nonzero and regular-inverse premises. Native meromorphic identity and derivative-order theorems provide the continuation and inverse-coordinate steps. Actual finiteChart consumers close the internal overlap hypotheses instead of leaving an abstract chart specification as the result.",
  "discharged": "The actual original uniformizer parameter at every finite place defines a genuine partial equivalence with its complex disk. Any two of these constructed finite-place charts have open overlap domain and analytic transition map. Repeated division of a regular original function by the order-one original uniformizer proves that differences of the two residue-value germs vanish to every order. Actual residue inversion handles poles. The native meromorphic identity theorem propagates these equalities over one common disk; normalized orders identify the original valuation rings and hence the actual place families. The public consumers instantiate all order, regularity and branch inputs with the already proved original finite-place parameters. Orders is a defined internal pointwise property, and ComparisonData packages narrower proved inputs; neither is presented as a separate existence proof or an assumed overlap conclusion.",
  "remaining": "Cusp coverage and compatibility with cusp parameters, global Hausdorff/compact/connected curve structure and the Abel-Jacobi comparison remain required. Original torsion finiteness/cardinality and comparison back to Qbar divisor classes remain open, followed by Tate realization, rank-two Hecke/Frobenius and inertia comparison, arithmetic automorphy and higher symmetric-power continuation. DUB-17--20 OPEN; 16/20. No acceptance gate closes here.",
  "production": "Scratch only; production promotion and verification pending.",
